    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "so if these structural changes like offshoring and tech shifts are just \"happening\" independently of politics, does that mean the inequality is basically inevitable? like, is there even a way to fix it through policy without just hurting the economy, or is the current system just designed to favor the top?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
